  "description": "The CyberKnife System is a fully robotic, non-invasive stereotactic radiosurgery (SRS) and stereotactic body radiation therapy (SBRT) platform developed by Accuray. It mounts a compact 6 MV linear accelerator (LINAC) onto a 6-axis articulated robotic arm, enabling targeted radiation delivery from hundreds of angles with sub-millimeter precision. Integrated real-time X-ray imaging and Synchrony motion tracking continuously adapt beam delivery to patient and tumor movement in real-time. Paired with the 6-DOF RoboCouch patient positioning couch, CyberKnife treats both intracranial and extracranial tumors across the body without rigid head frames.",
